# The root ignores lockfiles, a rule written for this directory's toolchain before it had one
# worth keeping. It has: `index.ts` is what npm publishes, so whatever formats, type-checks and
# tests it is part of how the published file gets its shape. Committed for the reason mcp/ commits
# its own — an unpinned toolchain is a different toolchain on the next install.
!package-lock.json
